      },
      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4btnd",
            "text": "我平时做品牌和包装设计。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 3,
                "offset": 27,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "3ilsg",
            "text": "前几年做过一款“锁鲜枸杞”，包装上的核心词就是两个字：锁鲜。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6buju",
            "text": "这次试 Nex-N2.5 Pro，我不太想拿它跑一道题，也不想再做一个普通的产品官网。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6r4eb",
            "text": "我只给了它原来的产品图和包装平面。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8e9hb",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5fi4v",
            "text": "然后提了一个很简单的想法：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 16,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "efq7g",
            "text": "如果“锁鲜”，真的可以锁住时间？",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "b6hna",
            "text": "最后我把页面压得很简单：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 14,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "dj2sq",
            "text": "一罐产品，一句话，一个按钮。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3sn25",
            "text": "正常状态下，枸杞、微尘和光线在产品周围缓慢流动；",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 3,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "ecnv8",
            "text": "点击 「锁住时间」，运动逐渐减速、静止，周围的光线慢慢向产品收束；",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 6,
                "offset": 4,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "3ioo0",
            "text": "再点击 「释放时间」，枸杞和粒子重新散开，时间继续流动。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "gnrh",
            "text": "我不会前端，也不会为了这个效果专门去学一遍交互开发。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 51,
                "offset": 5,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "cg3oj",
            "text": "这次是在 Kilo Code 的 Agent 环境里，通过 OpenRouter 调用 Nex-N2.5 Pro。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "52bs7",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4jrnq",
            "text": "从创建项目文件、写 HTML / CSS / JS，到实际运行页面和继续修改，它确实把一个原本只停留在脑子里的设计想法，变成了可以真正操作的东西。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3oqnc",
            "text": "当然，过程并不是“一句话就完美”。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "hatd",
            "text": "第一版能运行，但视觉很像普通网页。有一次它甚至判断交互已经正常，我自己实际点过以后，才发现按钮仍然有问题。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8a4nv",
            "text": "后来我继续从设计角度给反馈：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 54,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "f01qc",
            "text": "减掉网页感、强化产品主体、重新处理“锁住”和“释放”的节奏，再把“时间”这个抽象概念变成光、轨迹和运动状态。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6v04p",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "u5ut",
            "text": "最后才到了现在这一版。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6ju55",
            "text": "做下来最大的感受其实很简单：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 30,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "dbthv",
            "text": "它能把“不会编程”这道门槛跨过去，但它不天然等于“好设计”。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bl4qi",
            "text": "代码可以自己写，交互可以自己跑，最后那一下创意、构图、节奏和审美判断，还是得设计师自己来。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3cli4",
            "text": "但反过来看，这件事也很有意思。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aof4g",
            "text": "以前很多想法不是想不到，而是实现成本太高，所以最后就算了。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "e0h2o",
            "text": "现在至少可以先让 Agent 把它跑起来。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 44,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "550f8",
            "text": "AI 最有意思的地方，也许不是替你想，而是让以前做不出来的想法，第一次有机会真的动起来。",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "97t1r",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 12,
                "offset": 7,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "per9",
            "text": "这次使用的是 Nex-N2.5 Pro，通过 OpenRouter 接入。\n目前有免费体验入口，有兴趣可以自己试试：",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "urls": [
                {
                  "fromIndex": 0,
                  "text": "openrouter.ai/nex-agi",
                  "toIndex": 21
                }
              ]
            },
            "entityRanges": [],
